# ============================================================
# Altium Designer
# ============================================================

# Local history, previews, logs and generated outputs
**/History/
**/__Previews/
**/Project Logs for */
**/Project Outputs for */

# Generated project/cache files
*.PrjPcbStructure
*.SchDocPreview
*.PcbDocPreview
*.DsnWrk
*.DsnWrkStructure

# Temporary, backup and lock files
*.bak
*.BAK
*.$$$
*.REP
*.LOG
*.log
*.DWL
*.DWL2
~$*

# Automatically created CAMtastic sessions
CAMtastic*.Cam

# Altium package/output archives
**/ProjectPackages/
**/Packages/

